        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[SwiftUI @State와 @Binding 정리]]></title>
            <link>https://ellyheetov.github.io/paper/dev/ai_element</link>
            <guid>https://ellyheetov.github.io/paper/dev/ai_element</guid>
            <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[상태를 소유하는 뷰와 빌려 쓰는 뷰를 구분하면 데이터 흐름이 단순해진다.]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>SwiftUI에서 화면은 상태의 함수다. 상태가 바뀌면 뷰가 다시 그려지는데, 그 상태를 <strong>누가 소유하는지</strong>를 헷갈리기 시작하면 값이 엉뚱한 곳에서 바뀌거나 화면이 갱신되지 않는 문제가 생긴다.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="state-뷰가-직접-소유하는-상태">@State: 뷰가 직접 소유하는 상태<a href="https://ellyheetov.github.io/paper/dev/ai_element#state-%EB%B7%B0%EA%B0%80-%EC%A7%81%EC%A0%91-%EC%86%8C%EC%9C%A0%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%EC%83%81%ED%83%9C" class="hash-link" aria-label="@State: 뷰가 직접 소유하는 상태에 대한 직접 링크" title="@State: 뷰가 직접 소유하는 상태에 대한 직접 링크">​</a></h2>
<div class="language-swift codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-swift codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">struct</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">CounterView</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">View</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token attribute atrule">@State</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">private</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">var</span><span class="token plain"> count </span><span class="token operator" style="color:rgb(137, 221, 255)">=</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number" style="color:rgb(247, 140, 108)">0</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">var</span><span class="token plain"> body</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">some</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">View</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">Button</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">(</span><span class="token string-literal string" style="color:rgb(195, 232, 141)">"탭 </span><span class="token string-literal interpolation-punctuation punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">\(</span><span class="token string-literal interpolation">count</span><span class="token string-literal interpolation-punctuation punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">)</span><span class="token string-literal string" style="color:rgb(195, 232, 141)">회"</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">)</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">{</span><span class="token plain"> count </span><span class="token operator" style="color:rgb(137, 221, 255)">+=</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number" style="color:rgb(247, 140, 108)">1</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">}</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">}</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">}</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="클립보드에 코드 복사" title="복사" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<ul>
<li>뷰 안에서만 쓰는 단순한 값 타입 상태에 쓴다.</li>
<li><code>private</code>으로 선언해서 바깥에서 초기값을 주입하지 않도록 한다.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="binding-부모의-상태를-빌려-쓰기">@Binding: 부모의 상태를 빌려 쓰기<a href="https://ellyheetov.github.io/paper/dev/ai_element#binding-%EB%B6%80%EB%AA%A8%EC%9D%98-%EC%83%81%ED%83%9C%EB%A5%BC-%EB%B9%8C%EB%A0%A4-%EC%93%B0%EA%B8%B0" class="hash-link" aria-label="@Binding: 부모의 상태를 빌려 쓰기에 대한 직접 링크" title="@Binding: 부모의 상태를 빌려 쓰기에 대한 직접 링크">​</a></h2>
<div class="language-swift codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-swift codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">struct</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">ToggleRow</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">View</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token attribute atrule">@Binding</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">var</span><span class="token plain"> isOn</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">Bool</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">var</span><span class="token plain"> body</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">some</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">View</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">Toggle</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">(</span><span class="token string-literal string" style="color:rgb(195, 232, 141)">"알림"</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">,</span><span class="token plain"> isOn</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">:</span><span class="token plain"> $isOn</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">}</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">}</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">struct</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">SettingsView</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">View</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token attribute atrule">@State</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">private</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">var</span><span class="token plain"> notificationsOn </span><span class="token operator" style="color:rgb(137, 221, 255)">=</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token boolean" style="color:rgb(255, 88, 116)">true</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">var</span><span class="token plain"> body</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="font-style:italic">some</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">View</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token class-name" style="color:rgb(255, 203, 107)">ToggleRow</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">(</span><span class="token plain">isOn</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">:</span><span class="token plain"> $notificationsOn</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">}</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(199, 146, 234)">}</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="클립보드에 코드 복사" title="복사" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p><code>ToggleRow</code>는 값을 직접 갖지 않고, 부모가 가진 <code>notificationsOn</code>에 대한 참조만 받는다. 토글을 움직이면 부모의 상태가 바뀌고, 부모와 자식이 함께 다시 그려진다.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="한눈에-비교">한눈에 비교<a href="https://ellyheetov.github.io/paper/dev/ai_element#%ED%95%9C%EB%88%88%EC%97%90-%EB%B9%84%EA%B5%90" class="hash-link" aria-label="한눈에 비교에 대한 직접 링크" title="한눈에 비교에 대한 직접 링크">​</a></h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>프로퍼티 래퍼</th><th>소유자</th><th>언제 쓰나</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>@State</code></td><td>현재 뷰</td><td>이 뷰만 쓰는 상태</td></tr><tr><td><code>@Binding</code></td><td>부모 뷰</td><td>부모 상태를 읽고 바꿔야 할 때</td></tr></tbody></table>
<blockquote>
<p>상태는 한 곳에서만 소유하고, 나머지는 빌려 쓴다.</p>
</blockquote>]]></content:encoded>
